 "effect_check": "supports",
 "effect_summary_en": "A London randomised trial (Thorax 2023) found that reading the chest X-ray straight away cut the median time from X-ray to lung cancer diagnosis from 63 to 32 days, a saving of 31 days (p=0.03, 49 cancers).",
